<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Mpoto Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Bhasesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa ja kabhele jaka Paulo kwa Bhasesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Bhasesalonike</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Bhas</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa ja kabhele jaka Paulo kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Bhasesalonike</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Baluwa ja kabheli kwa Bhasesalonike jakalembakiki na Mtumi Paulo (Sula 1:1). Akalembiki baluwa jenu chikahi chijipi pena paakajomwili kujilemba ja kutumbula kwa Bhasesalonike iwezikana mu chaka cha 51 baada ja kubhelakeka kwaka Yesu Kristo. Paulo akabhi akona akabya mu muchi wa ku Kolinso paakalembiki baluwa jenu kwa likanisa lelakabhi ku Sesalonike, likanisa leakalitumbulili chikahi cha mwanja waki wa kabheli wa kiutumika (Matendu 17:1-10). Ilembakiki mu chitabu cha Matendu kubha likanisa haleli lakatumbuliwi na bhahobhalela bhakumu bhabhabhili na asili ja Kiyahude, na Bhayunani nde bhabhabhi bhamaheli.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ipwaghakika kubha likanisa la Bhasesalonike lakapaliki namaa kumanya mambu ghamaheli gha chikahi cha kujomukela na panani ja mambu gha kuhika kwaka Yesu mala ja kabheli, kwa kubha Paulo akalembiki ghamaheli kubhokana na lijambu leniheli mu baluwa yokapi ibheli kwa Bhasesalonike. Pambipi nusu jokapi ja baluwa ja kabheli jilongalela chikahi cha ujomukelu. Paulo kabhete alakalila kubhokana na ukata. Kila mundu impalika kuhenga lihengu nahuli kulipatila chilebhi (Sula 3:6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ghaghabhihomu</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo atumbula kulemba baluwa jaki kwa kulimanyiha jombi mwene na bhajaki (Sula 1:1-2).</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete Paulo anchengula Chapanga kwa ndandi ja likanisa lelibhi ku Sesalonike na kubhalobhela (Sula 1:3-12).</para>
  <para style="io">Paulo alongalela chikahi cha ujomukelu mkati ja Sula ja 2.</para>
  <para style="io">Kabhete Paulo alakalila ukata na kubhapwaghila bhandu kubha ibhapalika kutenda lihengu (Sula 3:1-15).</para>
  <para style="io">Kwa kujomulela, Paulo ajomulela kwa kubhalamukila kabhete (Sula 3:16-18).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1"/>Nepani Paulo, na Silivano na Timoseo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Tundembela likanisa la ku Sesalonike, mwembi muka Chapanga Atati witu na Bambo Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2"/>Chihomu na chibya kwinu, na lukwali yeihuma kwaka Chapanga Atati witu, na kwaka Bambo Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Utemulu chikahi cha kuhika kwaki Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3"/>Ndongu, itupalika kunchengula Chapanga chikahi chokapi kwa ndandi jinu. Ilenganela kwitu kutenda bhelabhela maghambu uhobhalelu winu ukola namaa na kupalana kwinu kujonjukeka namaa. <verse eid="2TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4"/>Nde ndandi tepani tulilumbalila mwehapa pachilanda ja makanisa ghokapi ghaka Chapanga. Tulilumbalila panani ja ntundu monjendalela kuhobhalela na kuhinakila mu mang'ahiku ghokapi na ulali ghomupata.<verse eid="2TH 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5"/>Ghanihagha ghokapi ghalangiha kubha utemulu waka Chapanga nde wachakaka, na kwa ndandi heji mwehapa anambalangiwaje kubha mpalakiki kupekewa Ukolongwa waka Chapanga, ambau mwehapa mng'ahika kwa ndandi jaki. <verse eid="2TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6"/>Chapanga anatenda ghaghapalika: Jombi anaabhalepa mang'ahiku bhala bhabhung'aha mwehapa, <verse eid="2TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7"/>na kumpekeha chiheku mwehapa mwemung'ahika papamu na tepani. Chikahi Bambo Yesu panaapitalyaje kuhuma kunani kumahunde papamu na bhatumika bhaki bha kunani bhabhabhi na makili, <verse eid="2TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8"/>na mu imuli ya moto. Anaabhalapulaje bhala bhangakummanya Chapanga na ambabhu ngachebhatii Malobhi Manyahi ghaka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9"/>Utemulu wabhu anaukubha kuyonangeka mileli na kubhekakeka kutali na pamihu jaka Bambo na ulumbalilu wa uwezu waki, <verse eid="2TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10"/>chikahi panaahikaje Lichobha lela la kujopalela ulumbalilu kuhuma kwa bhandu bhaki na utopelu kuhuma kwa bhokapi bhabhunhobhalela. Mwehapa nanamu anamkubha papamu nabhu, kwa ndandi muuhobhalili ulandilu ghotundetile.<verse eid="2TH 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11"/>Ndemana tundobhela chikahi chokapi panga kutonda, nahuli kubha Chapanga apata kumbalanga kubha mpalakiki na ulohakeku waki na kubha kwa uwezu waki apata kuhenga kila lengu linu lamboni na kila litendu lelilonguheka na uhobhalelu winu. <verse eid="2TH 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12"/>Kwa ntundu hoghu, Lihina laka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo analipata ulumbalilu kuhuma kwinu, na mwehapa anampata ulumbalilu kuhuma kwaki kwa chihomu chaka Chapanga witu na chaka Bambo Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 1:12"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">Muhakau Jola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1"/>Bhalongu bhangu bhapalu, kubhokana na kuhika kwaki Bambo witu Yesu Kristo na kulibhongana kwitu papamu palongi jaki: Bhalongu, tundobha namaa, <verse eid="2TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2"/>ngamwing'ahika manyata mu mitima, na wala ngamwijeghaleka choghohi kwa roho wala Lilobhi au baluwa yeipwaghakika kubha ihumiki kwitu. Yeipwagha kubha Lichobha laka Bambo lijomwi kuhika. <verse eid="2TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3"/>Ngamwijetakela kukoluheka na mundu jokapi kwa ntundu wokapi ghola. Maghambu Lichobha heli ngalihiki mbaka hoti uasi ghola upitalyaje na Muhakau Jola apitalyaje, ambaju ujomukelu waki nde kuyonangeka nakanopi. <verse eid="2TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4"/>Jombi anaapengaje na kulikweha panani ja kila chindu chechilowakeka Chapanga au chechijojabhaleka, na hata kulibheka mweni mu Nyumba jaka Chapanga, koni akalitangaza mweni kubha nde Chapanga.<verse eid="2TH 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5"/>Bho, ngachemkomboka kubha panakabhi papamu na mwehapa nakumpwaghili mambu ghanihagha? <verse eid="2TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6"/>Nambu kubhi na chindu chechunhibhalakila sajenu, na mwehapa mchimanyi chindu hechi. Henu, Muhakau hoju anaahyekuliwaje mu chikahi chaki chechipalika. <verse eid="2TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7"/>Hata bhela, Muhakau hoju joahiyakiki atenda lihengu sajenu, nambu ngaabhonikani mbaka jola joanhibhalakila abhohakikaje. <verse eid="2TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8"/>Panihapa nde Muhakau jola panaapitalyaje, nambu Bambo Yesu paanahikaje anaankomaee kwa mbomu ja ndomu waki na kumuyonanga kwa ung'anyi wa kuhika kwaki. <verse eid="2TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9"/>Muhakau hoju anahikaje na makili ghaka Shetani na kutenda kila ntundu wa nginyulila na ngangachu ya upuhi, <verse eid="2TH 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10"/>na kutenda ukoluheku wa kila ntundu kwa bhala bhabhabhi mu nkumbu wa kuhobha. Bhanihabha anabhahobhaje kwa ndandi ngachebhakaujopalili na kuupala uchakaka ghola nahuli bhakengaliwaje. <verse eid="2TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11"/>Ndemana Chapanga abhabhekiki pahi ja makili gha kuhobha, nahuli bhauhobhalya upuhi. <verse eid="2TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12"/>Mapitalilu ghaki nde kubha bhokapi bhangakuhobhalela uchakaka, nambu bhahekalela mahoku, anabhatemulikaje.<verse eid="2TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Muhaghuliki mpataje kukengalewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13"/>Nambu itupalika tepani kunchengula Chapanga machobha ghokapi kwa ndandi jinu, bhalongu mwempalakika na Bambo, kwa ndandi Chapanga akanhawili mwehapa kutumbula pakutumbulila nahuli mkengaliwaje kwa kugholuleka na makili ghaka Roho, mtendakikaje bhandu bhaki bhahuhu kwa kuhobhalela uchakaka. <verse eid="2TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14"/>Chapanga akandohili lijambu leniheli kwa indela ja Malobhi Manyahi ghatukuntangazile, akandohiki mpata kushiliki mu ulumbalilu waka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="2TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15"/>Henu, bhalongu bhapalu, njemaje kwa ukangamalu na mughakamulaje namaa mabholu ghala ghatukumboliki ikubhi kwa malobhi gha ndomu au kwa baluwa yitu.<verse eid="2TH 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16"/>Bambo witu Yesu Kristo mweni na Chapanga Atati witu, joatupaliki na kwa chihomu chaki akatupekihi chiheku cha mileli na lihobhalelu lambone mu chihomu, <verse eid="2TH 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17"/>anjeghala mitima jinu, na kuntenda mkangamalaje mu kila lilobhi na litendu lambone.<verse eid="2TH 2:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3"/>
  <para style="s">Mtulobhilaye kwaka Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1"/>Ujomukelu, bhalongu, mtulobhilaje nahuli kubha ubholu waka Bambo upetalyaje kujaghanila manyata na kujopalewa kwa utopelu ngati bhela moubheli pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="2TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2"/>Ndobhaje kabhete nahuli Chapanga atukengalyaje na bhandu bhahakau na bhana mahoku, maghambu nga bhokapi bhabhuhobhalela ubholu hoghu.<verse eid="2TH 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3"/>Nambu Bambo nde ndongwana, najombi anaampekya ukangamalu mwehapa na kundenda wichu na Muhakau Jola. <verse eid="2TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4"/>Na jombi Bambo atupekeha lihobhalelu likolongwa panani jinu, na ngachetubhi na choghohi kubha mtenda na ananjendalya kutenda ghala ghatukumpwaghile.<verse eid="2TH 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5"/>Bambo ajilonguhaje mitima jinu mu umanyi ukolongwa wa upalu waka Chapanga na mu uhinakalilu ghotupekewa na Kristo.<verse eid="2TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lilakalilu kubhokana na ukata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6"/>Bhalongu, tundaghalakila mu Lihina laka Bambo Yesu Kristo, mulijepaje na bhalongu bhokapi bhabhabhi bhakata na ambabhu ngachebhajengalela malaghalakilu ghatukumpekihi mwenga. <verse eid="2TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7"/>Maghambu mwehapa mabheni mmanyi ntundu moipalakila kujengalela ulenganesu witu. Tepani ngachetukabhi vakata patukabhi papamu na mwehapa, <verse eid="2TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8"/>wala ngachetukalili chilebhi chaka mundu jokapi panga na kulepa. Tukahengiki lihengu kwa ukangamalu na mang'ahiku na ikilu na muhi nahuli ngatwikubha chibwahila kwaka mundu jokapi pachilanda jinu. <verse eid="2TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9"/>Tukatendiki anana, nga kwa ndandi ngachetupalika kupata ujangatilu winu, nambu kwa ndandi tupala kumpekeha ulenganesu. <verse eid="2TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10"/>Patukabhi papamu na mwehapa, tukampekihi amuli: “Mundu jokapi jwangakupala kuhenga lihengu, ngayikula chilbhi.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11"/>Kwa kubha tujowana kubha bhakumu bha bhandu pachilanda jinu nde bhakata. Ngachebhahenga mahengu ghabhu bheni, nambu bhalijingiha mu mambu gha bhandu bhangi. <verse eid="2TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12"/>Henu bhandu ngati bhanihabha tundaghalakila na kundakalila mu lihina laka Bambo Yesu Kristo bhahengaje lihengu kwa kulilongoha bheni na kulipatila ghaghapalika mu matamu ghabhu bhene.<verse eid="2TH 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13"/>Nambu mwehapa bhalongu, ngamwitonda kutenda ghambone! <verse eid="2TH 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14"/>Ngati mundu jokapi ngacheghatii malaghalakilu ghitu ghaghabhi mu baluwa jenjenu, mulilingalya namaa na mundu hoju. Wala ngamwijangatana naku, nahuli kubha apata kubhona ihoni. <verse eid="2TH 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15"/>Nambu ngamwambalanga kubha adui, nambu mundakalyaje ngati ndongo.<verse eid="2TH 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulamukilu wa kujomulela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16"/>Henu, Bambo wa lukwali mweni ampekye lukwali chikahi chokapi na kwa kila indela. Bambo akubha na mwehapa mabhokapi.<verse eid="2TH 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17"/>Nepani Paulo, nundembela ulamukilu ghoni kwa chiwoku changu namwete. Jeniheji nde alama jangu mu baluwa yangu yokapi, kubha anana nde monembela.<verse eid="2TH 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18"/>Chihomu chaka Bambo witu Yesu Kristo chibya papamu na mwehapa mabhokapi. Amina.<verse eid="2TH 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3"/>
</usx>
